---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import Placeholder from "../components/Placeholder.astro";

// TODO: remove noindex once the real privacy details have been filled in.
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy – a placeholder that must be filled with the real details before going live."
  noindex={true}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Badge tone="amber">Placeholder</Badge>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-pretty text-slate-400">
      This page is a placeholder. The sections marked with
      <Placeholder>[…]</Placeholder> must be replaced with the real privacy
      details and legally reviewed before going live.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          1. Controller
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The controller responsible for data processing on this website is:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Name / Company:</span>
            <Placeholder>[First and last name / company name]</Placeholder>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Address:</span>
            <Placeholder>[Street, postal code, city, country]</Placeholder>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Email:</span>
            <Placeholder>[Email address]</Placeholder>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-slate-500">Phone:</span>
            <Placeholder>[Phone number]</Placeholder>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. Hosting</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website is hosted by an external service provider (processor).
          Personal data collected on this website is stored on the host's
          servers. The host processes the data on our behalf and is
          contractually obliged to comply with the GDPR.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Hosting provider: <Placeholder>[Name and address of the host]</Placeholder>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. Server log files</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The provider of the pages automatically collects and stores
          information in so-called server log files, which your browser
          automatically transmits to us. These are:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Operating system used</li>
          <li>Referrer URL</li>
          <li>Hostname of the accessing computer</li>
          <li>Time of the server request</li>
          <li>IP address</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This data is not merged with other data sources. Collection is based
          on Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR to ensure trouble-free operation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website uses
          <Placeholder>[no / only technically necessary / optional]</Placeholder>
          cookies. Details on the cookies used and their storage duration must
          be added here.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you contact us by email or via a contact form, your details,
          including the contact data you provide, will be stored by us for the
          purpose of processing the request and in case of follow-up questions.
          The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (b) or (f) GDPR.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Within the framework of the applicable legal provisions, you have the
          right at any time to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Access your stored personal data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Rectify incorrect data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Erase your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Restrict processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          7. Right to complain to a supervisory authority
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You have the right to complain to a data protection supervisory
          authority about the processing of your personal data. The responsible
          authority is:
          <Placeholder>[Name and address of the responsible supervisory authority]</Placeholder>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          8. SSL/TLS encryption
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For security reasons and to protect the transmission of confidential
          content, this site uses SSL/TLS encryption. You can recognize an
          encrypted connection by the fact that the browser's address bar
          changes from "http://" to "https://".
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          9. Changes to this privacy policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We reserve the right to adapt this privacy policy so that it always
          complies with current legal requirements or to implement changes to
          our services. The new privacy policy applies to your next visit.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Last updated: <Placeholder>[Date of last update]</Placeholder>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
